关Trial of the ChosenH��"Timeline_OuterLocations_6_LootName古修剑谱Ancient Sword Manual8��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_1_Name青篁	Qinghuang4��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_2_Name赤砾Chili4��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_3_Name白溪Baixi4��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_4_Name鹤归Hegui6��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_5_Name玄砂Xuansha8��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_6_Name重山	Chongshan6��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_7_Name闻潮Wenchao5��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_8_Name照夜Zhaoye5��#Timeline_StartingCultivators_9_Name孤松Gusong7��$Timeline_StartingCultivators_10_Name逐星ZhuxingJ��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_1_WeaponName	青竹剑Green Bamboo SwordD��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_2_WeaponName	斩妖刀DemoncleaverH��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_3_WeaponName	寒溪剑Coldstream SwordM��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_4_WeaponName	飞羽针Flying Feather NeedleJ��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_5_WeaponName	镇砂杵Sandbinding PestleK��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_6_WeaponName	开山斧Mountaincleaver AxeH��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_7_WeaponName	听潮剑Tidecaller SwordH��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_8_WeaponName	照夜枪Nightlight SpearG��)Timeline_StartingCultivators_9_WeaponName	松纹剑Pinegrain SwordG��*Timeline_StartingCultivators_10_WeaponName	逐星弓Starchaser Bow?��Timeline_StoryEvent_1_Title古修石门Ancient Stone GateB��Timeline_StoryEvent_2_Title枯井残卷Pages in the Dry Well=��Timeline_StoryEvent_3_Title濒死散修A Dying WandererF��Timeline_StoryEvent_4_Title黑牙巢遗物Relic of Blackfang DenD��Timeline_StoryEvent_5_Title断桥遗阵The Broken Bridge ArrayB��Timeline_StoryEvent_6_Title青禾旧簿The Old Qinghe Ledger8��Timeline_StoryEvent_7_Title临溪渡口Linxi FerryB��Timeline_StoryEvent_8_Title沉舟寻铃The Bell in the Wreck���Timeline_StoryEvent_1_Text�山壁嵌着一扇无锁石门。掌印深陷门中，石缝透出微弱剑鸣。唯有气血足够雄厚者，才能推开这道门。�A lockless gate is set into the cliff. Palm prints sink deep into the stone, and a faint sword hum seeps from the cracks. Only someone with great vitality can push it open.���Timeline_StoryEvent_2_Textx古井已经干涸，井底却有一线青光。你循着石阶而下，看见一枚玉佩压着几页散落的旧纸。�A pale green light shines at the bottom of the dry well. Down the stone steps, you find a jade pendant weighing down a few loose pages.���Timeline_StoryEvent_3_Text�散修倚在松根旁，气息渐弱。他握着一卷书，低声道：若有青髓玉护住心脉，或许还能活着走出这片山林。�A wanderer slumps against a pine root, breathing shallowly. Clutching a scroll, he whispers that green marrow jade might steady his heart long enough to leave the forest.���Timeline_StoryEvent_4_Textu妖兽倒下后，洞中终于安静。碎骨之间露出一只石匣，匣盖上的青色纹路仍在微微发亮。|The den falls quiet after the beast dies. A stone box protrudes from the bones, its lid still traced with faint green light.���Timeline_StoryEvent_5_Text�山涧截断了旧路。桥头残阵还留着一道接口，也许稍耗气血便能续上阵纹，替后来者铺出一条通途。�A ravine cuts off the old road. The damaged array at the bridgehead still has a socket. A little blood might restore it and give later travelers a way across.���Timeline_StoryEvent_6_Text�渡船簿上记着十二人。船夫数到十一便停了。他用指腹抹过纸上的空行，低声说：临溪那头还有一本底簿。�The ledger lists twelve passengers. The ferryman stops counting at eleven. He brushes a finger over the blank line and murmurs that a duplicate ledger lies across the water at Linxi.���Timeline_StoryEvent_7_Text�船夫沈砚在空船上摆了两只碗。他说自己曾替妹妹刮去一个名字。说完他盯着第二只碗，像是忘了刚才提起的是谁。�Shen Yan sets two bowls in an empty boat. He says he once scraped away a name for his sister. Then he stares at the second bowl as if he has forgotten who he meant.���Timeline_StoryEvent_8_Textr船舱横在回流里，缆绳一紧一松。断桨上刻着沈砚的名字，舱底那枚铃却一声也没响。�The wreck lies sideways in the backwash, its mooring tightening and slackening. Shen Yan’s name is carved into a broken oar. The bell below deck makes no sound.d��Timeline_StoryOption_101_Text运转气血，推开石门&Gather your strength and push the gate`��Timeline_StoryOption_102_Text记下掌印，暂且离开"Memorize the palm prints and leaveV��Timeline_StoryOption_201_Text下井查看青光!Climb down toward the green light`��Timeline_StoryOption_202_Text查看井边残字后离开"Read the worn characters and leave^��Timeline_StoryOption_301_Text以青髓玉佩救人&Save him with the Green Marrow Pendant]��Timeline_StoryOption_302_Text取走残卷，独自离开Take the scroll and leave alone^��Timeline_StoryOption_303_Text留下清水，继续赶路 Leave him some water and move onA��Timeline_StoryOption_401_Text打开石匣Open the stone boxH��Timeline_StoryOption_402_Text辨认洞中旧阵Study the old arrayM��Timeline_StoryOption_501_Text续接桥头残阵Restore the bridge arrayT��Timeline_StoryOption_502_Text踏上前人修复的桥Cross the repaired bridgeJ¤Timeline_StoryOption_503_Text沿山涧绕行Follow the ravine aroundUäTimeline_StoryOption_601_Text对照舱里的旧船牌Check the old tally aboard\ĤTimeline_StoryOption_701_Text问他第二只碗留给谁Ask who the second bowl is foreŤTimeline_StoryOption_801_Text解开缆绳，取出旧铃'Untie the mooring and retrieve the bell[ƤTimeline_StoryOption_802_Text沿断桨返回岸上#Follow the broken oar back to shorePǤTimeline_StoryOption_101_Hint需要最大生命 > 500Requires Max HP > 500_ȤTimeline_StoryOption_501_Hint桥已被前人修复'Someone has already repaired the bridgeYɤTimeline_StoryOption_502_Hint尚无人修复此桥!The bridge has yet to be repaired�ʤTimeline_StoryOption_101_ResultW石门缓缓移开。你从石台上取下一柄古剑，剑身虽残，锋芒未尽。uThe gate slowly opens. You take an ancient sword from the dais. Damaged as it is, its edge has lost none of its bite.�ˤTimeline_StoryOption_102_Result?你记下石门的纹路，决定来日气血充盈时再试。NYou memorize the marks on the gate and decide to return once you are stronger.�̤Timeline_StoryOption_201_Resultf青髓玉佩入手温润，灵气顺着经脉流转。旧纸早已朽坏，唯有玉佩保存完好。�The pendant feels warm in your hand. Spirit energy courses through your meridians. The pages have rotted away, but the jade is intact.�ͤTimeline_StoryOption_202_ResultB井壁记着一段吐纳心得。你默记片刻，转身离去。SThe well wall bears a short lesson in breathing. You commit it to memory and leave.�ΤTimeline_StoryOption_301_ResultZ玉佩护住了他的心脉。他将《敛息诀》交给你，低声说：此恩不忘。gThe jade steadies his heart. He gives you the Breath Veil Art and whispers, “I will remember this.”�ϤTimeline_StoryOption_302_Result]你伸手取卷，残留的护身灵气划伤手臂。身后的呼吸声渐渐低了下去。iAs you reach for the scroll, a trace of protective energy cuts your arm. Behind you, his breathing fades.�ФTimeline_StoryOption_303_ResultZ你将水囊放在他手边，记下这片松林的位置。山风吹过，前路仍在。mYou set your waterskin beside him and mark the grove in your memory. The wind stirs the pines as you move on.�ѤTimeline_StoryOption_401_Result]石匣里躺着一枚青髓玉佩。妖兽不识此物，倒让它躲过了岁月的侵蚀。iA Green Marrow Pendant lies inside. The beast never knew its worth, so it survived the years undisturbed.�ҤTimeline_StoryOption_402_ResultW你从破碎阵纹中悟出少许运气之法。洞中已无别的值得停留之物。|You learn a little about directing your breath from the shattered patterns. Nothing else in the den is worth lingering over.�ӤTimeline_StoryOption_501_Result~你以气血续上阵纹，守了一年。薄光终于跨过山涧，旧桥重新显出轮廓。后来者也能借此通行。�You feed the array with your blood and keep watch for a year. At last, pale light spans the ravine. The old bridge takes shape, ready for anyone who follows.�ԤTimeline_StoryOption_502_ResultT阵桥稳稳托住脚步。桥头有一道新刻痕，不知是谁曾在此驻留。[The bridge holds firm. A fresh notch at the bridgehead marks where someone once kept watch.�դTimeline_StoryOption_503_ResultH你沿着山涧寻找落脚之处，花了两年才绕过这段险路。DYou search the ravine for footing. It takes two years to get around.�֤Timeline_StoryOption_601_ResultT船牌刻着十二道痕。最后一道比其余的浅，像有人试着刮去它。[The tally bears twelve marks. The last is shallower, as if someone tried to scrape it away.�פTimeline_StoryOption_701_Resulto沈砚没答。他望向西南的回水湾，说旧船沉在那里，船上或许还留着她认得的东西。�Shen Yan does not answer. Looking toward the backwater to the southwest, he says the wreck might still hold something she would recognize.�ؤTimeline_StoryOption_801_ResultN水下的铃一出船舱，回流便停了一息。铃身刻着临溪两字。eAs the bell leaves the wreck, the current stills for a breath. The name Linxi is engraved on its rim.�٤Timeline_StoryOption_802_ResultZ你记住了进舱的路线。岸上还留着两行脚印，其中一行在水边断了。kYou memorize the way into the wreck. Two sets of footprints remain on the bank. One stops at the waterline.BڤTimeline_StoryItem_9101_Name青髓玉佩Green Marrow PendantBۤTimeline_StoryItem_9102_Name古修残剑Ancient Broken Sword:ܤTimeline_StoryItem_9103_Name	敛息诀Breath Veil Art<ݤTimeline_StoryIt