*�ItemName_9131	引火符Kindling Sigil��ItemDesc_9131c主动伤害技能命中时施加 2 层燃烧。同一轮施法对每个目标最多触发一次。@Active skill hits apply 2 Burn stacks, once per target per cast.*�ItemName_9132	添薪诀Feed the Flame��ItemDesc_9132Z命中已燃烧的目标时增加 1 层燃烧。每个目标每 2 秒最多触发一次。MHits add 1 stack to burning targets, at most once every 2 seconds per target.*��ItemName_9133	焚心印Heartfire Seal��ItemDesc_9133�主动技能命中已有 6 层燃烧的存活目标时，引爆全部层数。对目标及 2.5 格世界距离内的敌人造成每层 20% 攻击力的伤害。�Active skill hits detonate 6 existing Burn stacks on surviving targets, dealing 20% attack power per stack to enemies within 2.5 world units.)�ItemName_9134	余烬灯Ember Lantern��ItemDesc_9134f你引爆燃烧，或由你点燃的敌人死亡时，为最近的另一名敌人施加 2 层燃烧。fYour detonation or the death of an enemy you ignited applies 2 Burn stacks to the nearest other enemy.,�ItemName_9141	断势符Momentum Breaker���ItemDesc_9141a主动伤害技能命中施加虚弱，持续 4 秒，使目标造成的直接伤害降低 15%。fActive damage skills apply Weakness for 4 seconds, reducing the target’s direct damage dealt by 15%.,��ItemName_9142	探隙诀Find the Opening���ItemDesc_9142i普攻命中虚弱目标时叠 1 层破绽，最多 3 层。叠加时刷新破绽的 8 秒持续时间。`Basic attacks against weakened targets add 1 Opening, up to 3, refreshing its 8-second duration.,��ItemName_9143	截脉剑Meridian Severer���ItemDesc_9143r主动伤害技能命中仍存活且已有 3 层破绽的目标时，消耗破绽并追加 100% 攻击力伤害。jActive damage skills consume 3 Openings on surviving targets to deal an extra 100% attack power as damage.0��ItemName_9144	碎壁符Shatterwall Talisman���ItemDesc_9144l敌人以直接伤害打空你的护盾时，对其反击，伤害等于这次受击前剩余的护盾值。oWhen an enemy’s direct hit breaks your shield, deal damage back equal to the shield remaining before the hit.?��Timeline_StoryEvent_9_Title断刃石台Broken Blade Altar���Timeline_StoryEvent_9_Text?旧石台上插着一把细刃。刃口的血迹多年未干。VA slim blade sits lodged in an old stone altar. The blood on its edge has never dried.B��Timeline_StoryEvent_10_Title听风药庐Windwatch Apothecary���Timeline_StoryEvent_10_Text`药师端出一卷吐纳诀和一枚血玉，问你是想出手更快，还是想借伤养身。�The apothecary sets out a breathing manual and a bloodstone. Would you strike faster, or draw strength from the wounds you inflict?M��Timeline_StoryOption_901_Text拔出割脉刃Take the Vein-Cutting Blade[��Timeline_StoryOption_901_Result你将细刃收入行囊。You take the slender blade.=��Timeline_StoryOption_902_Text绕过石台Pass the altarc��Timeline_StoryOption_902_Result你让断刃留在原处。#You leave the blade where it rests.]��Timeline_StoryOption_1001_Text取疾风诀，出手更快Take Gale Art to strike faster��� Timeline_StoryOption_1001_Result'你记下了加快出手的吐纳法。;You learn a breathing technique that quickens your attacks.l��Timeline_StoryOption_1002_Text取饮血佩，以伤续命-Take the Blooddrinker Pendant to recover lifeb�� Timeline_StoryOption_1002_Result血玉入手微温。'The bloodstone feels warm in your hand.]��Timeline_StoryOption_1003_Text谢过药师，继续赶路Thank the apothecary and leavek�� Timeline_StoryOption_1003_Result你道别后继续前行。*You say farewell and continue on your way.-��ItemName_9190守怪扑击Guardian LungeZ��ItemDesc_9190!守怪向近处的敌人扑击。&The guardian lunges at nearby enemies.)��ItemName_9191	逆潮咬Undertow Biteu��ItemDesc_91913沉舟水妖缩身蓄力，扑咬近处的敌人。/The wreck beast coils and bites nearby enemies.)��ItemName_9192断碑重砸
