Skill #{0}/��Timeline_Technique_ItemHeld	已持有Owned4��Timeline_Technique_ItemMissing	未持有Missing>��Timeline_SwordTrial_Name临溪试剑坡Linxi Sword TrialX��Timeline_SwordTrial_Guardians战斗关卡 · 守怪 {0} 只Battle · {0} guardiansd��Timeline_SwordTrial_Experience#御剑诀经验 +{0}（{1} / {2}）Sword Art XP +{0} ({1} / {2})n��Timeline_SwordTrial_Kills)御剑诀本阶击杀 +{0}（{1} / {2}）&Sword Art skill kills +{0} ({1} / {2})���Timeline_SwordTrial_RankUp5御剑诀进阶至第 {0} 阶，下场使用「{1}」-Sword Art reached Rank {0}. Next battle: {1}.���#Timeline_Technique_SlashDescriptionE朝最近的敌人挥砍。\n基础伤害：{0} = [20 + 100%Attr_ATK]CSlash at the nearest enemy.\nBase damage: {0} = [20 + 100%Attr_ATK]���Timeline_Flavor_Skill_10莽夫必备。讲究的人管这叫起手式。=A brawler’s essential. The refined call it an opening move.p��Timeline_Flavor_Skill_1001'兵器长一寸，胆子就大一寸。)An inch more reach, an inch more courage.���Timeline_Flavor_Skill_8K师父只教了怎么放剑。收剑这事，是弟子后来自己悟的。dThe master only taught them how to send the swords flying. Calling them home took some figuring out.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9104H临溪的船家说，夜里听见铃响，就知道还有船没靠岸。\The Linxi boatfolk say that if you hear a bell after dark, a boat is still out on the water.���'Timeline_Technique_LongReachDescriptions朝当前目标方向横扫，命中前方扇形内的敌人。\n每名目标的基础伤害：{0} = [{1}%Attr_ATK]hSweep toward the current target, hitting enemies in a cone.\nBase damage per enemy: {0} = [{1}%Attr_ATK]���$Timeline_Technique_FlightDescription�施法期间每 0.2 秒放出一柄飞剑，瞄准攻击范围内的敌人，并穿过沿途目标。收招时在敌人最密集处引爆剑气。\n每次命中的基础伤害：{0} = [100%Attr_ATK]�Release a sword every 0.2s while casting. Each sword aims at an enemy in range and pierces enemies along its path. The cast ends with a burst where enemies are most clustered.\nBase damage per hit: {0} = [100%Attr_ATK]���(Timeline_Technique_BellShieldDescriptionq摇铃护身，生成持续 4 秒的护盾，同类护盾不可叠加。\n基础护盾值：{0} = [10%Attr_MaxHp]oRing the bell to gain a 4-second shield. Shields of this kind do not stack.\nBase shield: {0} = [10%Attr_MaxHp]���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9121H疾风门教人先练步。脚下乱了，手上再快也追不回来。\Gale disciples practice footwork first. Once your steps falter, quick hands cannot catch up.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9122K断刃石台上的血痕一层盖一层，最早那道早已看不清了。^Bloodstains overlap on the Broken Blade Altar. The oldest is long since lost beneath the rest.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_91239前一刀留下记号，后一刀才知道往哪儿落。:The first cut leaves a mark. The next knows where to fall.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9124B药师把佩递过来，只嘱咐一句：这东西只能救急。SThe apothecary handed over the pendant with one warning: use it only when you must.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9131<符纸只借你一星火，能不能烧旺就看后手了。DThe talisman lends you a spark. Keeping the fire alive is up to you.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_91329添柴要趁火还活着。守炉人就教了这一句。KFeed the fire while it still lives. That was all the furnace keeper taught.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_91333炼印的人在匣盖上刻了两个字：等够。9The seal maker carved two words on the case: wait longer.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_91349旧灯走到哪儿，灰里就有一星红跟到哪儿。CWherever the old lantern goes, a red spark follows through the ash.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_9141<练这道符的第一课，是等对方那口气先泄了。CThe first lesson is to wait until your opponent loses their breath.���Timeline_Flavor_Item_91429师父说，架势再稳，换气时也有一线空门。HThe master said even a perfect stance leaves a gap when you draw breath.�­Timeline_Flavor_Item_9143B看准了再出剑。磨锋可以花一夜，落剑只要一瞬。eTake your time to find the opening. You can sharpen the blade all night; the strike takes an instant.�íTimeline_Flavor_Item_9144H老阵师补了三回护壁，第四回干脆把反击画在裂缝上。lThe old ward-maker patched the barrier three times. On the fourth, he drew the counterstrike into the crack.,̭ItemName_9151	引雷针Lightning Needle�ͭItemDesc_9151�主修招式命中仍存活的敌人时，为其叠加一层雷印。每次出招对同一目标最多叠一层，雷印上限三层。�When your primary technique hits a surviving enemy, apply one Lightning Mark, up to three. Each cast can mark a target only once.'έItemName_9152	传雷符Storm Relay�ϭItemDesc_9152r带有你雷印的敌人倒下时，给最近的另一名敌人添一层雷印。传递本身不会引发落雷。�When an enemy bearing your mark falls, give the nearest other enemy one Lightning Mark. Transferring a mark does not call down lightning.2ЭItemName_9153	惊蛰印Awakening Thunder Seal�ѭItemDesc_9153�主修招式命中带有三层雷印的敌人时，消耗其雷印，造成120%攻击力的伤害。落雷最多跳两次，每跳寻找2.5单位内最近的未命中敌人，伤害降至上次的三分之二。�When your primary technique hits an enemy with three marks, consume the marks and strike for 120% Attack. The bolt jumps up to twice to the nearest unhit enemy within 2.5 units, each jump dealing two thirds of the previous hit._ҭTimeline_StoryOption_504_Text取出桥阵中的铜针$Lift the needle from the bridge wardlӭTimeline_StoryOption_504_Hint'须先修复桥阵，再回来察看。"Repair the bridge ward and return.�ԭTimeline_StoryOption_504_Result<铜针仍在发颤，针尾刻着临溪渡口的旧记号。JThe needle still quivers. An old Linxi Ferry mark is etched into its tail.WխTimeline_StoryOption_702_Text向渡人出示铜针Show the needle to the ferrymanV֭Timeline_StoryOption_702_Hint需持有引雷针。Requires the Lightning Needle.�׭Timeline_StoryOption_702_ResultN渡人以符纸裹住铜针，嘱你去青禾旧簿查雷阵的最后一笔。pThe ferryman wraps the needle in a talisman and sends you to the Qinghe Ledger for the final stroke of the ward.]حTimeline_StoryOption_602_Text循符纹查阅旧簿%Trace the talisman against the ledgerM٭Timeline_StoryOption_602_Hint需持有传雷符。Requires Storm Relay.�ڭTimeline_StoryOption_602_Result9簿页上的断线一一接起，汇成一枚惊蛰印。BThe broken lines on the page join into the Awakening Thunder Seal./�Timeline_BattleVictory战斗胜利Victory-�Timeline_BattleDefeat战斗失败Defeat9�Timeline_BattleSettlement战后结算Battle Resultss�Timeline_BattleBreakthrough+境界突破 · 第 {0} 层 → 第 {1} 层'Breakthrough · Level {0} → Level {1}`�Timeline_BattleTechniqueRank{0}进阶 · 第 {1} 阶 · {2}{0} advanced · Rank {1} · {2}R�Timeline_BattleTechniqueKills{0} · 本阶击杀 +{1}{0} · Stage kills +{1}P�Timeline_BattleTechniqueXP{0} · 功法经验 +{1}{0} · Technique XP +{1}8�Timeline_BattleDrops获得道具 · {0}Loot · {0}>�Timeline_BattleNoDrops本场无道具掉落No item drops��Timeline_BattleBacklash0仪式已重启。挑战者在反噬中身死。:The ritual restarted. Its backlash claimed the challenger.p�Timeline_LightningNextStop$雷印下一站 · {0}（{1}, {2}）,Lightning route · Next stop: {0} ({1}, {2})}�Timeline_BattleLightningCounts2叠印 {0} 次 